    "text": "The <math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term of the series is<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Where,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><